  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global IME Supporting Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Senior loan up to $30,000,000 (including B Loans of up to $10,000,000) to support financing for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in Nepal.

- Grant of $1,300,000 under ADF-PSW&amp;apos;s blended finance solution to address affordability issues for disadvantaged women-owned SMEs (WSMEs) (i.e., interest concessions for onward lending to WSMEs)

- Contingent grant of up to $1,000,000, through an unfunded risk transfer arrangement, under ADF-PSW&amp;apos;s loan guarantee solution, to cover a portion of the bank&amp;apos;s portfolio of uncollateralized loans to WSMEs.

- Technical assistance (TA) from an existing TA of up to $250,000 to support the bank&amp;apos;s digitization initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
